<<
/A 2970 0 R
/Alt (Infographic illustrating an integrated One Health data cube for AI-driven analysis, connecting environmental inputs such as weather, soil, crop stress, and remote sensing with agri-food system data including mycobiome profiles, toxin-gene load, mycotoxin assays, and market-chain variables, along with human health data like food consumption and health outputs. Icons and arrows show the flow of multimodal data into the cube, emphasizing multimodal integration, One Health linkage, and AI prediction for weather-to-human toxicopathology relationships.)
